        "upstream:dd6322d604e00eec1ba5e0c8541159906a21094a"
      ],
      "$notes": "Storage units carry a {name,version} header: single layout is one JSON document, per-record layout is <table>/<key>.json plus global.json. Per-domain versions are declared by the owning package and checked with version-mismatch refusal."
